			"notes": "### Changelog - Version 1.1.0 (Minecraft 1.20.1)\n\n**New Features**\n\n- Auto-Totem Refill: Added a smart inventory utility mechanic! If a Totem of Undying in your off-hand pops/shatters, the mod will instantly scan your main inventory and automatically equip a backup Totem into your off-hand.\n\n- Crouch-to-Pickup Mechanic: To prevent inventory clutter from mob farms or redstone contraptions, items dropped on the ground will no longer be picked up passively. Players must now sneak/crouch (Hold Shift) to collect items into their inventory.\n- \n\n**Update Feature**\n\n- Magnet Ring Overhaul: Integrated the Magnet Ring with the new pickup mechanic. The magnet will now remain passive during normal movement. Holding Shift will instantly activate the magnet, pulling all nearby items directly to you and picking them up seamlessly."
		},
